        "created_at": "2015-05-06T23:59:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>AAARGGGHHHH!</p><p>Two more loses. On one of them I started with a first turn brain burn and STILL couldn't find a way to win. On the other I used Savage Mana to grab most of the underbosses and thugs, then unleashed them to take out the Operative. Visionary was in a coccoon and AZ was racking up hit points, but I still couldn't keep my team alive.</p>",
