        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-07T16:07:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That’s something I really like about Rook City: for all its awfulness, it’s one of the few environments with cards that explicitly help out the heroes. It’s nice to take advantage of them when you can!</p>",
