        "created_at": "2015-05-09T14:20:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Two more losses on this before getting another win. This time I discovered the job of having a 2 HP Visionary go into the coccoon and then tank all the damage that would have gone to Tremata or Taurus. I also enjoyed using a Rampage to take out about ten underbosses and thugs while using Twist the Ether on The Operative to alternately beef up Absolute Zero or hit AZ w/ fire and have it redirected back to The Operative, THEN using Savage Mana to one-shot The Chairman after pulling the same Twist The Ether/Absolute Zero shenanigans. I took The Chairman and The Operative from full health to zero and 4 HP in one round, putting The Chairman under Savage Mana.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, yeah, with the right card draws I know how to win this now, but I'm still not particularly satisfied. I still haven't figured out how to win this w/out Savage Mana _and_ Twist the Ether.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
